Lojban is not, because it doesn't have the vocabulary necessary to express 
everything that a native speaker might want to express.
>
We can  [auto]generate the huge list of [random] words, put it to jbovlaste, 
give the access to anyone, wanting to allocate the word for a meaning, or just 
automatically allocate one for each word of each natlang. So, we'll get the 
"richest" vocabulary in a few  months. Is that your definition of "polished"?

